=2 Walkthrough
* Trade {n:Melyon} any of the following to complete this quest.

=4 Notes:
* Repeating this quest several times is the easiest way to improve your reputation in {p:Bastok}, {p:San d'Oria}, {p:Jeuno}, {z:Selbina}, and {z:Rabao}.
* 6 stacks of {i:Boyahda Moss|Boyahda Moss|919} should reach Fame level 9, or
* 24 stacks of {i:Millioncorn|Millioncorn|629} should reach Fame level 9, or
* 75 stacks of {i:La Theine Cabbage|La Theine Cabbage|4366} should reach Fame level 9

